<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 200 0 R
/E (The model is fundamentally relational: a user subscribes to N services, each service exposes N widgets, and each widget has N instances. PostgreSQL provides both relational features AND JSON; MongoDB would provide only JSON.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [33]
>>
endobj
